<title>JAPAN: Sony to begin selling notebook PCs in U.S. July 1.</title>
<headline>Sony to begin selling notebook PCs in U.S. July 1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp said on Tuesday that it will start selling its notebook personal computers in the United States on July 1.</p>
<p>It has already been selling desktop PCs in the United States since September 1996.</p>
</text>
